#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create, update, and use instances to run jobs with free or paid plans."
msgstr ""
"Gumawa, i-update, at gumamit ng mga instance para magpatakbo ng mga job sa "
"libre o bayad na mga plano."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances"
msgstr "Gumawa at pamahalaan ang mga instance"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances {#create-and-manage-instances}"
msgstr "Gumawa at pamahalaan ang mga instance {#create-and-manage-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Access to IBM Quantum Platform services is controlled by the **instances** "
"to which you are assigned. Users can belong to multiple instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang access sa mga serbisyo ng IBM Quantum Platform ay kinokontrol ng mga "
"**instance** na nakatalagang sa iyo. Maaaring maging bahagi ang mga user sa "
"maraming instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instances are virtual servers (deployments of Qiskit Runtime) that manage "
"the execution of your workloads, including executing quantum programs and "
"classical compute tasks (such as processing error mitigation).  Instances "
"are identified by their *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN). This CRN can be used "
"when sending workloads from your Qiskit programs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga instance ay virtual server (mga deployment ng Qiskit Runtime) na "
"namamahala sa pagpapatakbo ng iyong mga workload, kasama na ang pagpapatakbo"
" ng mga quantum program at mga classical compute task (tulad ng pagpoproseso"
" ng error mitigation). Ang mga instance ay kinikilala sa pamamagitan ng "
"kanilang *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN). Maaaring gamitin ang CRN na ito kapag "
"nagpapadala ng mga workload mula sa iyong mga Qiskit program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can see the instances you have access to on the dashboard, or by "
"clicking the \"Instances\" tab from the dashboard. Each instance is listed "
"with its CRN identifier.\n"
msgstr ""
"Makikita mo ang mga instance na accessible sa iyo sa dashboard, o sa "
"pamamagitan ng pag-click sa tab na \"Instances\" mula sa dashboard. Ang "
"bawat instance ay nakalista kasama ang CRN identifier nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You need a different instance for every service plan (such as Open or Pay-"
"As-You-Go) you use in every region that you want to use. The account manager"
" and anyone with enough permission can create an instance and define its "
"configuration, such as its allocations, usage limits, quantum computers, and"
" user permissions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kailangan mo ng ibang instance para sa bawat service plan (tulad ng Open o "
"Pay-As-You-Go) na ginagamit mo sa bawat rehiyon na nais mong gamitin. Ang "
"account manager at sinuman na may sapat na pahintulot ay maaaring gumawa ng "
"instance at tukuyin ang configuration nito, tulad ng mga allocation, usage "
"limit, quantum computer, at user permission.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The IBM Quantum Platform [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) "
"displays the instances to which you have access. Depending on your access, "
"you can view full details, edit, and delete instances on the [Instances "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng IBM Quantum Platform "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) ang mga instance na accessible "
"sa iyo. Depende sa iyong access, maaari kang tingnan ang buong detalye, mag-"
"edit, at magtanggal ng mga instance sa [Instances "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is important that you understand which instance you are using, because "
"all instances that are not associated with the Open Plan incur a cost (or "
"count toward your plan's alloted time).\n"
msgstr ""
"Mahalaga na maintindihan mo kung aling instance ang ginagamit mo, dahil "
"lahat ng instance na hindi kaugnay ng Open Plan ay nagdudulot ng gastos (o "
"mabibilang sa oras na inilaan ng iyong plano).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs you run and the jobs run by other collaborators in the same instance count toward the reported usage for that instance. \n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang mga job na pinapatakbo mo at ang mga job na pinapatakbo ng ibang mga collaborator sa parehong instance ay binibilang sa iniuulat na paggamit para sa instance na iyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can view an instance's usage on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, or, for those with the proper authority, the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.  Note that the pages might show different usage numbers because the Instance page shows total usage prior to the current timestamp, while the Analytics page uses full-day boundaries.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong tingnan ang paggamit ng instance sa pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), o, para sa mga may wastong awtoridad, sa pahina ng [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics). Tandaan na maaaring magpakita ng iba't ibang numero ng paggamit ang mga pahina dahil ang Instance page ay nagpapapakita ng kabuuang paggamit bago ang kasalukuyang timestamp, habang ang Analytics page ay gumagamit ng buong araw na mga hangganan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan instance {#open-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance ng Open Plan {#open-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open Plan users can run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free "
"(up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). The QPU usage can be tracked "
"on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga gumagamit ng Open Plan ay makakapagtakbo ng mga quantum circuit sa "
"pinakamahusay na QPU sa mundo nang libre (hanggang 10 minuto bawat 28-araw "
"na rolling window). Maaaring subaybayan ang paggamit ng QPU sa [Platform "
"dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) at sa mga pahina ng "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Pay-As-You-Go Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must create an "
"instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this"
" plan incur a charge. Pay-as-you-go instances can have a total cost limit "
"(optional).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Pay-As-You-Go Plan ay isang bayad na plano. Para gamitin ang planong "
"ito, kailangan mong gumawa ng instance at italaga ito sa plano. Lahat ng "
"workload na ipinadala sa mga QPU gamit ang planong ito ay may katumbas na "
"bayad. Ang mga pay-as-you-go instance ay maaaring magkaroon ng kabuuang cost"
" limit (opsyonal).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan instance {#flex-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance ng Flex Plan {#flex-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Flex Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to "
"sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads "
"sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Flex Plan ay isang bayad na plano. Para gamitin ang planong ito, "
"kailangan mo munang [makipag-ugnayan sa "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para "
"mag-sign up. Pagkatapos, gumawa ng instance at italaga ito sa plano. Lahat "
"ng workload na ipinadala sa mga QPU gamit ang planong ito ay mabibilang sa "
"iyong inilaan na subscription.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An administrator can set a usage limit on a Flex Plan instance that applies "
"for the duration of the contract. If an instance has been marked as "
"\"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" column in "
"the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined by your "
"administrator), any active workload will continue running (including "
"sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is "
"available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its "
"allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower "
"priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaaring magtakda ang isang administrator ng usage limit sa isang Flex Plan "
"instance na naaangkop sa buong tagal ng kontrata. Kung ang isang instance ay"
" minarkahang \"limited\" ng iyong administrator (makikita mo ang kolumnang "
"\"Remaining\" sa lugar ng paggamit) at ang instance ay lumampas sa "
"allocation nito (na tinutukoy ng iyong administrator), ang anumang aktibong "
"workload ay magpapatuloy sa pagpapatakbo (kasama ang mga session) ngunit ang"
" mga nakabintang workload ay mananatili sa queue hanggang sa may magamit na "
"mas maraming oras. Kung ang isang instance ay hindi limited at lumampas sa "
"allocation nito, ang mga job na pinapatakbo gamit ang instance na iyon ay "
"malamang na tatakbo sa mas mababang priority at makakaranas ng mas matagal "
"na oras ng paghihintay sa queue.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An alert displays on an instance's usage when it has exceeded its "
"allocation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang alerto ang lalabas sa paggamit ng instance kapag nalampasan na nito "
"ang allocation nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan instance {#premium-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance ng Premium Plan {#premium-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Premium Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to "
"sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads "
"sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Premium Plan ay isang bayad na plano. Para gamitin ang planong ito, "
"kailangan mo munang [makipag-ugnayan sa "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para "
"mag-sign up. Pagkatapos, gumawa ng instance at italaga ito sa plano. Lahat "
"ng workload na ipinadala sa mga QPU gamit ang planong ito ay mabibilang sa "
"iyong inilaan na subscription.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An administrator can set a usage limit on a Premium Plan instance that "
"applies for the plan's 28-day rolling usage window.  If an instance has been"
" marked as \"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" "
"column in the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined "
"by your administrator), any active workload will continue running (including"
" sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is"
" available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its "
"allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower "
"priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaaring magtakda ang isang administrator ng usage limit sa isang Premium "
"Plan instance na naaangkop sa 28-araw na rolling usage window ng plano. Kung"
" ang isang instance ay minarkahang \"limited\" ng iyong administrator "
"(makikita mo ang kolumnang \"Remaining\" sa lugar ng paggamit) at ang "
"instance ay lumampas sa allocation nito (na tinutukoy ng iyong "
"administrator), ang anumang aktibong workload ay magpapatuloy sa "
"pagpapatakbo (kasama ang mga session) ngunit ang mga nakabintang workload ay"
" mananatili sa queue hanggang sa may magamit na mas maraming oras. Kung ang "
"isang instance ay hindi limited at lumampas sa allocation nito, ang mga job "
"na pinapatakbo gamit ang instance na iyon ay malamang na tatakbo sa mas "
"mababang priority at makakaranas ng mas matagal na oras ng paghihintay sa "
"queue.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an instance in your code {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"
msgstr ""
"Tukuyin ang isang instance sa iyong code {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the CRN or instance name to specify an instance to use - either "
"when initializing the service, or when sending the workload to a QPU (for "
"example, with "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). For instructions to specify an"
" instance in your code, see [Initialize your account](/guides/initialize-"
"account).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang CRN o pangalan ng instance para tukuyin ang instance"
" na gagamitin — alinman kapag ini-initialize ang serbisyo, o kapag "
"nagpapadala ng workload sa isang QPU (halimbawa, gamit ang "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). Para sa mga tagubilin sa "
"pagtukoy ng instance sa iyong code, tingnan ang [I-initialize ang iyong "
"account](/guides/initialize-account).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When an instance is passed in, only backends and jobs from that instance are"
" available (allowed in Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 and later).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag naipasa na ang isang instance, tanging ang mga backend at job mula sa "
"instance na iyon lang ang available (pinahintulutan sa Qiskit Runtime "
"v0.40.1 at mas bago).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an instance is not included when initializing the service, all backends "
"and jobs across all instances in your account are available. In this case, "
"when a backend is specified, an instance that can access the backend is "
"found and used as described in [Automatically select the "
"instance](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung hindi kasama ang isang instance kapag ini-initialize ang serbisyo, "
"lahat ng backend at job sa lahat ng instance sa iyong account ay available. "
"Sa kasong ito, kapag tinukoy ang isang backend, mahahanap at magagamit ang "
"isang instance na may access sa backend ayon sa pagkakalarawan sa "
"[Awtomatikong piliin ang instance](/guides/initialize-account#auto-"
"select).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Required versions\">\n"
"Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 or later is required for the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Mga kinakailangang bersyon\">\n"
"Ang Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 o mas bago ay kinakailangan para sa mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the instance name to specify an instance\n"
msgstr "Paggamit ng pangalan ng instance para tukuyin ang isang instance\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Not passing in an instance\n"
msgstr "Hindi pagpapasa ng instance\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Setting a preferred instance type and region\n"
msgstr "Pagtakda ng preferred na uri ng instance at rehiyon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Qiskit Runtime v0.42 or later, free plans are prioritized by default when [automatic instance selection](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select) is used.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa Qiskit Runtime v0.42 o mas bago, ang mga libreng plano ay pinaprioritahan bilang default kapag ginamit ang [awtomatikong pagpili ng instance](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create an instance {#create-an-instance}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng instance {#create-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to create an instance and add it to your account. If you "
"are an administrator who needs to set up Qiskit Runtime on Cloud for your "
"organization, refer to [Plan Qiskit Runtime for an "
"organization](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para gumawa ng instance at idagdag ito sa "
"iyong account. Kung ikaw ay isang administrator na kailangang mag-set up ng "
"Qiskit Runtime sa Cloud para sa iyong organisasyon, sumangguni sa [Planuhin "
"ang Qiskit Runtime para sa isang organisasyon](/guides/considerations-set-"
"up-runtime).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To add an instance to your account, first ensure you have the correct "
"account and region selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para magdagdag ng instance sa iyong account, tiyaking piliin muna ang tamang"
" account at rehiyon sa account switcher sa header.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can have (or be part of) multiple IBM Cloud accounts.  If you don't see "
"the instances or jobs you're expecting, try a different account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang magkaroon (o maging bahagi) ng maraming IBM Cloud account. Kung "
"hindi mo nakikita ang mga instance o job na inaasahan mo, subukan ang ibang "
"account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see"
" and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged"
" in to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong ma-access ang alinmang rehiyon gamit ang parehong API key, "
"ngunit makikita at maa-access mo lang ang mga instance na ginawa sa rehiyong"
" naka-log in ka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want to create an Open instance, you must choose the us-east "
"region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gusto mong gumawa ng Open instance, kailangan mong piliin ang rehiyong "
"us-east.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is"
" immediately to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is "
"immediately to the right of the account "
"switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg 'IBM Quantum "
"Platform header')\n"
msgstr ""
"        ![Ipinapakita ang header ng IBM Quantum Platform. Ang account "
"switcher ay kaagad sa kanan ng search bar. Ang region switcher ay kaagad sa "
"kanan ng account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg "
"'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"
msgstr "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"About regions\">\n"
"   The instance will be created in the selected region. This region determines these important characteristics:\n"
"     * Which QPUs are available.\n"
"     * Where the jobs' classical computation, such as compilation, takes place.\n"
"     * Where the user's workflow data remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tungkol sa mga rehiyon\">\n"
"   Ang instance ay gagawin sa napiling rehiyon. Tinutukoy ng rehiyong ito ang mga mahalagang katangian na ito:\n"
"     * Kung aling mga QPU ang available.\n"
"     * Kung saan nagaganap ang classical computation ng mga job, tulad ng compilation.\n"
"     * Kung saan nananatili ang workflow data ng user.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The workflow data includes the input circuits, circuit parameters, and "
"quantum computation results.  It does not include metadata, such as number "
"of shots, size of circuits, or other job statistics.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Kasama sa workflow data ang mga input circuit, circuit parameter, at mga"
" resulta ng quantum computation. Hindi nito kasama ang metadata, tulad ng "
"bilang ng shot, laki ng mga circuit, o iba pang mga istatistika ng job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   To avoid exposure of the user's workflow data to a global Distributed Denial of Service protection layer, you can use [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). `qiskit-ibm-runtime` supports this through the [`private_endpoint` parameter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"   Para maiwasan ang pagkakalantad ng workflow data ng user sa isang global na Distributed Denial of Service protection layer, maaari kang gumamit ng [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). Sinusuportahan ito ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` sa pamamagitan ng [`private_endpoint` parameter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the dashboard Instances pane, click **View all**, or go to the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page from the main "
"menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mula sa Instances pane ng dashboard, i-click ang **View all**, o pumunta sa "
"pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) mula sa "
"pangunahing menu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From the Instances page, click **Create instance**.\n"
msgstr "Mula sa Instances page, i-click ang **Create instance**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a name and optionally add tags.\n"
msgstr "Magpasok ng pangalan at opsyonal na magdagdag ng mga tag.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have access to more than one resource group in IBM Cloud&reg;, you "
"can choose to change the resource group this instance belongs to. See "
"[Managing resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"rgs&interface=ui) and [Giving access to resources in resource "
"groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) "
"for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung mayroon kang access sa mahigit isang resource group sa IBM Cloud&reg;, "
"maaari kang pumili na baguhin ang resource group na kabilang ang instance na"
" ito. Tingnan ang [Pamamahala ng mga resource "
"group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs&interface=ui) at"
" [Pagbibigay ng access sa mga resource sa mga resource "
"group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) "
"para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select the pricing plan this instance is associated with (for example, Pay-"
"As-You-Go). Depending on the pricing plan selected, you can specify other "
"options, such as the cost limit or the number of minutes to allocate to this"
" instance. Note that if this instance is not associated with a free plan, a "
"cost will be incurred when this instance is used to run workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Piliin ang pricing plan na kaugnay ng instance na ito (halimbawa, Pay-As-"
"You-Go). Depende sa pricing plan na napili, maaari kang tumukoy ng ibang mga"
" opsyon, tulad ng cost limit o bilang ng minuto na ilalaan sa instance na "
"ito. Tandaan na kung ang instance na ito ay hindi kaugnay ng libreng plano, "
"magkakaroon ng gastos kapag ginamit ang instance na ito para magpatakbo ng "
"mga workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Next**. A list of the QPUs the instance can access is shown.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-click ang **Next**. Ipapakita ang listahan ng mga QPU na maa-access ng "
"instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want the instance to have access to all the QPUs listed (and all QPUs"
" added to this plan in the future), click **Next**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gusto mong magkaroon ng access ang instance sa lahat ng QPU na "
"nakalista (at lahat ng QPU na idaragdag sa planong ito sa hinaharap), "
"i-click ang **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - If you are not setting up an open instance, you can customize which QPUs can be accessed with this instance. Click the \"Customize allocated compute resources\" toggle. Select specific QPUs that this instance can access, then click **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      If you customize the allocated compute resources, the available QPUs will never be automatically updated, regardless of any changes made to the parent plan.  However, you can manually add or remove QPUs later. If you do not customize them, you will always have access to any QPU to which the account has access on the plan. So if in the future there is a new QPU added to the plan, the instance automatically has access to it.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. The Access group pane opens. A \"collaborators\" access group is automatically created for this instance. Users added to this access group can use the time allocated to this instance. You can [modify or create additional access groups](/guides/access-groups) by using the [IBM Cloud console](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). See [Setting up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) for instructions.\n"
"1. Click **Create instance**. You can now view the instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. If you have set up multiple plans on your account, each plan type has its own tab on the Instances table.\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Kung hindi ka nagse-set up ng open instance, maaari mong i-customize kung aling mga QPU ang maa-access gamit ang instance na ito. I-click ang toggle na \"Customize allocated compute resources\". Pumili ng mga tiyak na QPU na maa-access ng instance na ito, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Kung i-customize mo ang mga inilaan na compute resource, ang mga available na QPU ay hindi kailanman awtomatikong maa-update, anuman ang mga pagbabago na ginawa sa parent plan. Gayunpaman, maaari kang mano-manong magdagdag o magtanggal ng mga QPU sa ibang pagkakataon. Kung hindi mo i-customize ang mga ito, palagi kang magkakaroon ng access sa anumang QPU na accessible ng account sa plano. Kaya kung sa hinaharap ay may bagong QPU na idaragdag sa plano, awtomatikong magkakaroon ng access sa ito ang instance.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. Magbubukas ang Access group pane. Isang access group na \"collaborators\" ay awtomatikong ginagawa para sa instance na ito. Ang mga user na idinagdag sa access group na ito ay maaaring gamitin ang oras na inilaan sa instance na ito. Maaari mong [baguhin o gumawa ng karagdagang access group](/guides/access-groups) gamit ang [IBM Cloud console](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). Tingnan ang [Pag-set up ng mga access group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) para sa mga tagubilin.\n"
"1. I-click ang **Create instance**. Maaari mo na ngayong tingnan ang instance sa pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Kung nag-set up ka ng maraming plano sa iyong account, ang bawat uri ng plano ay may sariling tab sa Instances table.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pending workloads\">\n"
"The Pending workloads column on the Instances table shows the number of workloads currently queued in this instance across all QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga nakabintang workload\">\n"
"Ang kolumnang Pending workloads sa Instances table ay nagpapakita ng bilang ng mga workload na kasalukuyang naka-queue sa instance na ito sa lahat ng QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Edit an instance and its allocation {#edit-an-instance-and-its-allocation}"
msgstr ""
"I-edit ang isang instance at ang allocation nito {#edit-an-instance-and-its-"
"allocation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find the instance on the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Click the "
"overflow menu at the end the instance's row, and select Edit details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hanapin ang instance sa pahina ng "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). I-click ang overflow "
"menu sa dulo ng row ng instance, at piliin ang Edit details.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Tanging ang mga administrator at may-ari lang ang maaaring mag-edit ng instance. Tingnan ang gabay na [Gumawa ng mga access policy at access group](/guides/access-groups) para sa impormasyon tungkol sa pagtatalaga ng access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances {#archived-instances}"
msgstr "Mga archived na instance {#archived-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An archived instance is the result of one of the following scenarios.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang archived na instance ay resulta ng isa sa mga sumusunod na "
"sitwasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A privileged user has archived the account {#a-privileged-user-has-archived-"
"the-account}"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang privileged na user ay nag-archive ng account {#a-privileged-user-"
"has-archived-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A user with sufficient privileges for the account has archived the instance.\n"
"    - Any pending jobs in the instance are canceled.\n"
"    - Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances page.\n"
"    - Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
"    - Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
"    - The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
"    - A user with sufficient privileges can reactivate an instance that they (or another privileged user) archived at any time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang user na may sapat na pribilehiyo para sa account ay nag-archive ng instance.\n"
"    - Anumang mga nakabintang job sa instance ay kakanselin.\n"
"    - Ang mga archived na instance ay lilitaw sa isang hiwalay na seksyong \"Archive\" sa pahina ng Instances.\n"
"    - Maaari pa ring makuha ang mga job.\n"
"    - Hindi maaaring mag-submit ng mga bagong job ang mga user sa archived na instance.\n"
"    - Ang archived na instance ay hindi mabibilang sa allocation ng iyong plano.\n"
"    - Ang isang user na may sapat na pribilehiyo ay maaaring muling i-activate ang isang instance na kanilang (o ng ibang privileged na user) na-archive anumang oras.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To archive an instance you manage, go to the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. At the end of the"
" row for that instance, click the three-dot overflow menu on the right, then"
" select *Archive instance*.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para mag-archive ng instance na iyong pinamamahalaan, pumunta sa pahina ng "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Sa dulo ng row para sa"
" instance na iyon, i-click ang three-dot overflow menu sa kanan, pagkatapos "
"ay piliin ang *Archive instance*.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Account no longer has access to the instance's plan {#account-no-longer-has-"
"access-to-the-instances-plan}"
msgstr ""
"Ang account ay wala nang access sa plano ng instance {#account-no-longer-"
"has-access-to-the-instances-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The account no longer has access to the plan under which the instance was "
"created.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang account ay wala nang access sa plano kung saan ginawa ang instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances"
" page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga archived na instance ay lilitaw sa isang hiwalay na seksyong "
"\"Archive\" sa pahina ng Instances.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
msgstr "Maaari pa ring makuha ang mga job.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi maaaring mag-submit ng mga bagong job ang mga user sa archived na "
"instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang archived na instance ay hindi mabibilang sa allocation ng iyong plano.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instances that have been archived because they no longer have visibility "
"into the instance's plan can't be reactivated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga instance na na-archive dahil wala na silang visibility sa plano ng "
"instance ay hindi maaaring muling i-activate.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Work with access groups](/guides/access-groups).\n"
"- [Manage users](/guides/invite-and-manage-users).\n"
"- [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
"- [Initialize the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/initialize-account) in a trusted Python environment.\n"
"- [Initialize the Qiskit Runtime service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- [Makipagtulungan sa mga access group](/guides/access-groups).\n"
"- [Pamahalaan ang mga user](/guides/invite-and-manage-users).\n"
"- [I-save ang iyong mga kredensyal sa pag-login](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
"- [I-initialize ang serbisyo ng Qiskit Runtime](/guides/initialize-account) sa isang pinagkakatiwalaang Python environment.\n"
"- [I-initialize ang serbisyo ng Qiskit Runtime sa isang **hindi pinagkakatiwalaang environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
